title: "WS4: Wood Supply Simulation System (Spatially explicit)"
abstract: "A CLI-first, HPC-ready forest estate model that makes spatial structure part of the model: fragments are the decision units, blocks aggregate them at runtime, and adjacency, patch structure, and road access are enforced in simulation and optimization."
authors:
  - name: "UBC FRESH Lab"
